                <mxCell id="vm-serveis" value="&lt;b&gt;srv-serveis (Ubuntu Server 24.04 LTS + Docker)&lt;/b&gt; — IP: &lt;b&gt;10.0.20.10&lt;/b&gt; (GW: 10.0.20.1)&lt;br&gt;Contenidors Docker de Negoci:&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;avigest_mariadb&lt;/b&gt; (MariaDB 10.11: Port 3306) + Triggers &amp; Vistes&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;avigest_mariadb_replica&lt;/b&gt; (Standby GTID: Port 3307)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;avigest_mosquitto&lt;/b&gt; (Broker MQTT Central: Port 1883)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;avigest_ldap&lt;/b&gt; (OpenLDAP: Port 389/636) &amp; phpLDAPadmin (:8081)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D1FAE5;strokeColor=#059669;fontColor=#064E3B;align=left;spacingLeft=15;" parent="box-lan" vertex="1">
